OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled at UK
OL,4,Aairports as air traffic control issue
OL,5,Acauses widespread disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FPhil White, travelling to Lanzarote,
OL,8,Fhas been stuck on the runway at Gatwick
OL,9,Ffor hours. "The pilots have been on
OL,10,Fevery 20 minutes saying they are
OL,11,Fwaiting for information," he tells us
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Chloe Davis, an aspiring
OL,14,Fpilot, takes the opportunity to explore
OL,15,Fthe cockpit on her delayed Virgin
OL,16,FAtlantic plane to Orlando
OL,18,FRyanair says 65,000 of its passengers
OL,19,Fhave been delayed by up to eight hours
OL,20,Fwhile British Airways warns of a
OL,21,F"significant knock-on impact for
OL,22,Fcustomers and colleagues"
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
